Third-party code
----------------

stb_vorbis, by Sean Barrett
Repository: https://github.com/nothings/stb/blob/master/stb_vorbis.c
License: MIT or public domain (Unlicense), at the user's option; full text in
format-notices/ogg/LICENSE

  Copyright (c) 2017 Sean Barrett

The pure-JavaScript Vorbis decoder follows the Vorbis I specification, with
parts taken from stb_vorbis:
- the Huffman codeword assignment in `Codebook.buildHuffman`
  (src/resource/formats/ogg/core/vorbis.js) is a JavaScript translation of
  stb_vorbis's `compute_codewords`;
- the 10-bit fast lookup table and the `NO_CODE` marker follow stb_vorbis's
  design.
The floor1 `inverse_db_table` is the Vorbis I specification's table. The IMDCT
factorization is original.

